  "releaseNotes": "- Add Run and Workflow isa xlsx files\n- Add fields to Assay\n- Add fields to Datamap\n- Flattened ArcInvestigation into ARC class\nAdditions:\ncleanup version control and release tag generation\nbump node version in ci to 18\ncleanup npm dependencies\nfinish up release pipeline rework\ncontinue reworking package build tasks\nadjust python transpilation and build chain to ts changes\nswitch from vite packaging to tsc\nUpdate DesignPrinciples.md\nsmall tweaks to ts packaging\ncontinue working on build targets for ts release\nrefactor js fs bindings and finish up vitest implementation\nstart working on typescript support\nadd workflow and run contract handling tests\nadd workflow and run contract handling\nadd run spreadsheet parser and tests\nupdate and test ArcInvestigation Run and Workflow handling\nadd ArcRun Type\nimplement and test ArcWorkflow Spreadsheet parsing\nstart working on workflow spreadsheet parsing\nadd identifier, title and description to assay according to specification changes\nadd ArcWorkflow type\nupdate methods and tests according to ARC ISA flattening\nstart flattening ARC class\ninclude label in datamap spreadsheet parsing\nbump to 2.5.1\nDeletions:\nremove py index file generation\nBugfixes:\ntry fix esbuild in ci\nfix jsnativetests copying correct index file\nfixes and cleanup to ts packaging\nupdate to vitest and fix jsnative tests\nadd tests for arcworkflow and arcrun and according fixes\nsmall fix to assay/study rename/remove failing in python",
